# Employee Sales Performance Analysis (SQL Server / T-SQL)

## Question
Who are the top-performing sales employees, both by total revenue and by average order value?

## Data
Microsoft's Northwind sample database (Employees, Orders, Order Details tables).

## Approach
- Calculated total orders and total revenue per employee using JOINs and GROUP BY
- Computed average revenue per order to compare employees fairly regardless of order count
- Scored employees 1–5 using the NTILE window function based on average order value

## Tools
SQL Server, T-SQL, CTEs (WITH), Window Functions (NTILE)

## Key Insight
The employee with the highest total revenue was not the same employee with the highest average order value — showing that volume and deal size are two different dimensions of performance.
